,"actors":[{"creditedName":"入野 自由","creatorId":"vndb:s2577","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2577","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2577","name":"入野 自由","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:68248","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c43583","characterName":"松野 おそ松","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c43583"},"originalCharacterName":"松野 おそ松","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The oldest and leader of the sextuplets, as well as the best fighter in the group. His name comes from osomatsu (お粗末), which means lame or ill-prepared in Japanese. He is often immature and self-centered, and often gets on his brothers' nerves. He has a standard expression and often dresses in red."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c43583"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/03/03b3783bf5fd74708d282e11ba23cdd3cce3d5849404e168f6320279ae3d677e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/32/326e79c9bb8d6040e2750af5779dd978a15de874d38405258c161f2e7a399eb8.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"櫻井 孝宏","creatorId":"vndb:s50","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s50","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s50","name":"櫻井 孝宏","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:68232","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c43584","characterName":"松野 カラ松","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c43584"},"originalCharacterName":"松野 カラ松","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The second brother. Likes to play tough and cool, but so far he really isn't doing a good job. Is ignored by his brothers most of the time, so even the slightest compliments make him happy."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c43584"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5f/5f1959a95ee066723fde35f9882558674f64539d421486de8940d1de36e19839.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/63/6385d8b75812307714e536b2bd3097626ad447a6c8ba706edc3f329786a26aec.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"中村 悠一","creatorId":"vndb:s348","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s348","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s348","name":"中村 悠一","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:68240","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c43585","characterName":"松野 チョロ松","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c43585"},"originalCharacterName":"松野 チョロ松","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The third brother. Since he is the only one among the sextuplets with common sense he often plays the tsukkomi role, but that doesn't prevent him from joining in on his brothers oddities now and then. He really likes cute girls and idols. His distinguishing feature is his angular mouth and he often dresses in green."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c43585"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c2/c29de4ff4107c0cbc8bd94cce924944c291c73f7dc4feffdfd7d86be8feb0403.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/48/4866c32470b9932107d8ecf88780adcd2a7f7fb208fe005aa4aea6511618e3f8.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"神谷 浩史","creatorId":"vndb:s132","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s132","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s132","name":"神谷 浩史","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:68237","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c43586","characterName":"松野 一松","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c43586"},"originalCharacterName":"松野 一松","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The fourth brother. He is cynical and generally disinterested in things, but has a soft spot for cats. His distinguishing features are his tired eyes and scruffy hair, and he often dressed in purple."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c43586"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/03/03c61ec74c7057b9eb1fdc55b64dbc5d40330715bcc4d710f01b27eba66ae03d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a8/a82a1508944c5459f5760dfbe02a0b27a53cbc83ec0e8de0451a52cf49a7f404.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"福山 潤","creatorId":"vndb:s393","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s393","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s393","name":"福山潤","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:68244","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c43587","characterName":"松野 十四松","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c43587"},"originalCharacterName":"松野 十四松","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The fifth brother. Easily the most hyperactive of the siblings, Juushimatsu is enthusiastic about baseball and often exhibits crazed behavior, sometimes even defying the laws of reality. His distinguishing features as his crazed eyes, wide open mouth, and a single cowlick compared to the other siblings' two. He often dresses in yellow."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c43587"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a1/a16e6c3ac2dfff37e0ac4a7a7371325ef56a8ecc8f747defdc6fb72c5da12142.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/39/39f2261856190f40c95b8d49c442e9f9950c24bb4763cb7b5ce5821f01270d56.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"小野 大輔","creatorId":"vndb:s103","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s103","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s103","name":"小野 大輔","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:68235","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c43588","characterName":"松野 トド松","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c43588"},"originalCharacterName":"松野 トド松","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The sixth and the youngest brother. He is carefree and somewhat effeminate, which leads to some success with other girls, but still has his limits concerning his brothers, who he tries to keep his personal life away from. His distinguishing feature is his smaller mouth and he often dresses in pink."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c43588"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e1/e1963f156acea5659c5f146fd08b9dcf804ea0cad7b78d8499ca31f7d4e829cd.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/80/80aadb741884dae116e75f459b1f7b7a2c207e567ff94f6f81328409d1e8b7f0.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"入野 自由","creatorId":"vndb:s2577","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2577","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2577","name":"入野 自由","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:68247","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c58173","characterName":"弱井 トト子","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c58173"},"originalCharacterName":"弱井 トト子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The heroine of the series, who desperately strives to become a fish-themed idol in order to gain fame and fortune. She is still the object of the sextuplets' crushes, but often finds their admiration unwelcome, despite relying on their help to become an idol."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c58173"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/46/460a2da09421fb5ff67f9e5bd0553ec6f8521948904ed132128164c1f5d947ad.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/40/401265b46c540e9fdc5ec37e1f2c45ed4a8b015ab98f2929155a9e1cb0fd0d92.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"遠藤 綾","creatorId":"vndb:s5699","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s5699","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s5699","name":"遠藤 綾","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:68249","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c58174","characterName":"イヤミ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c58174"},"originalCharacterName":"イヤミ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Iyami is a very flashy and mischievous man who claims to be from France. His most notable features are his 3 large buckteeth, his thin moustache, and his Beatles-style haircut. He refers to himself in the first person as Me (ミー mii?) and other people as Chimi (チミ?) and usually ends his sentences with ~zansu (〜ザンス?). His trademark pose of flexing his arms and legs and shouting Sheeeh! (シェー?) became a popular trend all over Japan. He was modeled after Japanese vaudevillian Tony Tani. He is usually single and is unpopular with women. His occupation and role in the series often changes. In his first appearance he was a doctor. He has also been a teacher at Osomatsu's school, a co-worker of Matsuzō's, and even a police detective pursuing Chibita, but he is almost always actually a con artist or beggar. Early on in the 1988 anime he is officially a salesman, but this is eventually discarded and he begins to appear as corrupt doctors and other such things. It is often hinted that he is not actually from France, and probably has never even been there. Such hints include trying to eat the shells of escargot and being corrected about French facts by students who have been to France."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c58174"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4c/4cb82e24a41e5a6a302eaad95186ea1f2c27e92016523b87cb466993a171cb98.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/04/0442e0387dfb79